      "created_at": "2012-08-23T05:57:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The cost to ship the two mini expansions is now about half what it was when I originally posted.&nbsp; Still a bit more than a USPS flat-rate box, which would be $5.75 in this case, but no longer completely (in Liz Lemon's famous phrase) a deal-breaker.</p>",
